;
; How Hedgerow files one opening or closing in MYRA (hedgerow_rules.h HR6):
; its sequence number, its path (1 lan, 2 online, 3 answering peers,
; 4 the phone link, 5 hosted spaces, 6 the IRC gateway), whether it opened
; (1) or closed (0), its port (0 when the path has none) and when, in
; seconds since 1970. The rules say what the values may mean; this says
; whether they make a record.
^ZXHEDGEROW(seq:i9) = path:i1! ^ open:i1! ^ port:i5! ^ stamp:i11!
